  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Given the chart data, When the chart validator runs, Then charts exist for heads-up, 6-max and full ring and a missing chart fails validation [REQ-032.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Given the heads-up and full-ring charts, When the chart validator runs, Then every position at those sizes in each situation that applies to it (unopened pot, facing one or more limpers, facing a raise, facing a raise and calls, facing a re-raise, blind defence) assigns an action to all 169 hand classes [REQ-032.2]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Given the heads-up or full-ring chart file without a plain-English justification, When the chart validator runs, Then validation fails naming the chart [REQ-032.4]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Given a preflop PlayerView at each table size from 2 to 10, When advice is requested, Then the chart used is heads-up for 2, 6-max for 3 to 7 and full ring for 8 to 10 [REQ-005.4, REQ-032.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Given a heads-up preflop PlayerView on the button, When advice is requested, Then the recommendation comes from the heads-up chart cell for that hand class and situation [REQ-032.1]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Given a heads-up preflop decision where the big blind faces a fourth bet (button raised, big blind re-raised, button re-raised) with a hand class whose heads-up big-blind facing-a-re-raise cell is raise, When advice is requested, Then it uses that heads-up cell and returns call because the street is capped [REQ-032.6]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Given a full-ring preflop decision where UTG faces a fourth bet (UTG raised, CO re-raised, BB re-raised), When advice is requested for a hand class whose full-ring UTG facing-a-re-raise cell is raise and for one whose cell is fold, Then it uses those full-ring cells and returns call and fold respectively [REQ-032.6]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Given preflop decisions at the first seat to act, When advice is requested, Then 4-handed uses the 6-max CO cell, 5-handed the 6-max HJ cell, both of the two earliest 7-handed seats the 6-max UTG cell, and 8-handed the full-ring cell of the position 5 seats before the button [REQ-005.4]",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Given charts for table sizes 2-10, When the playtest's defaultPolicyFactory seats bots, Then TAG sits in every seat at every supported size and the random-move fallback is removed",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Given 10-seat preflop charts exist, When TASK-3.13's e2e/rapid-pace.spec.ts 10-player check (SPEC-05) runs with the real TAG bots instead of its test-only policy, Then every bot action after the user's preflop fold shows within 300 ms",
      "checked": false
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Given a playtest with --lineup at 2 to 10 seats, When it runs after full-ring and heads-up advice exist, Then every line-up seat plays its own style in every hand (the TASK-6.6 random-move fallback for non-6-seat hands and its Line-up note are removed) and zero invariant violations are reported",
      "checked": false
    }
